:58.920" end="01:00.240">tattoo</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.390" end="01:06.450"><span begin="01:00.390" end="01:00.990">Happy </span><span begin="01:00.990" end="01:01.650">birthday </span><span begin="01:01.650" end="01:02.010">to </span><span begin="01:02.010" end="01:02.970">you </span><span begin="01:02.970" end="01:03.420">was </span><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:05.010">created </span><span begin="01:05.010" end="01:05.760">for </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:06.450">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.480" end="01:09.720"><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:06.840">Can't </span><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.200">ever </span><span begin="01:07.200" end="01:07.530">keep </span><span begin="01:07.530" end="01:07.740">from </span><span begin="01:07.740" end="01:08.370">falling </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:09.720">apart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.720" end="01:11.490"><span begin="01:09.720" end="01:10.470">At </span><span begin="01:10.470" end="01:10.650">the </span><span begin="01:10.650" end="01:11.490">seams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.970" end="01:15.270"><span begin="01:11.970" end="01:12.330">Can't </span><span begin="01:12.330" end="01:12.540">I </span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:13.110">believe </span><span begin="01:13.110" end="01:13.230">you're </span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.800">taking </span><span begin="01:13.800" end="01:14.070">my </span><span begin="01:14.070" end="01:15.270">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.390" end="01:17.520"><span begin="01:15.390" end="01:16.290">To </span><span begin="01:16.290" end="01:17.520">pieces</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.610" end="01:22.470"><span begin="01:17.610" end="01:19.680">Oh</span><span begin="01:19.680" end="01:19.950">, </span><span begin="01:19.950" end="01:20.310">it'll </span><span begin="01:20.310" end="01:20.790">take </span><span begin="01:20.790" end="01:20.910">a </span><span begin="01:20